    "description": "Serverless computing is an execution model where a cloud provider allocates compute resources on demand, scaling to zero when idle. Developers deploy functions or entire applications without managing servers.\n\nPHP runs serverlessly via AWS Lambda with ``Bref``, ``Google Cloud Functions``, ``Azure Functions``, or ``Vercel``. The ``bref`` package is the most common bridge, wrapping PHP applications for Lambda execution.",
